1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jorgen Torsteinsen, his wife, Synneva Tollevdatter and their children, Knud, Christina (Tena), Thorsen and Marte came to the US in 1865 with entry via Canada. Jorgen and Synneva lived in Callendar Webster County, I
2 CONC owa in 1900 census. Thompson is US for Torsteinsen 
2 CONT
2 CONT The family lived on Aakre farm in Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1903 death record is hard to find.   Our man from Norway seems to be "John Thronson" in New Oregon, Howard Iowa in the 1880 US census with wife "Susan" and in the 1905 Iowa census as "John Thompson", widowed in Story county where 
2 CONC children were nearby at that time
