1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/106388283/haaken-eliasson-espe
2 CONT
2 CONT Haaken Eliasson Espe BIRTH	15 Apr 1842 Norway DEATH	21 Nov 1925 (aged 83) Radcliffe, Hardin County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Radcliffe Cemetery Radcliffe, Hardin County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Haakon Espe was born near Ullensvang Norway and immigrated in 1868 with 12 others in a small boat to Quebec Canada then to Lee Co. Illinois and settled in 1870 near Radcliffe Iowa. He established a huge farm where his descendants 
2 CONC continue to live. He celebrated 50 yrs of marriage to fellow Norwegian native Guhnild Prestegaard Espe and gave generations following a start to a new life to farm on some of the richest soil on earth. While Norway was the family'
2 CONC s homeland they had to leave it's beauty for a new opportunity after an avalanche destroyed their summer pasture and left them near poverty stricken. Courage and fortitude and much personal hardship created possibilities for the E
2 CONC spe children and they now realize how they are indebted to Haakon and Gunhild for their great hardships and many sacrifices.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunhilda Jorgensdatter Prestegaard Espe 1846–1933 (m. 1870)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Julia Espe Birkland 1871–1942
2 CONT
2 CONT George Espe 1872–1953
2 CONT
2 CONT Belle Thompson 1877–1974
2 CONT
2 CONT Georgiana Espe 1880–1949
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Espe Tapp 1882–1971
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena Espe Gossard 1884–1967
2 CONT
2 CONT Elias Espe 1887–1973
