2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/174619087/person/272264601130/facts Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 16 2021, 20:46:50 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the first postmaster in Ølen:
2 CONT
2 CONT From the local history magazine for Ølen and Bjoa, "Segn og Soge" anno 1984:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Sentral as Ølensjøen has always been, it was natural that a post office came there. The first Postmaster was farmer Endre Sjursen Heggen. He took up the position on July 1, 1861 ... Endre Sjursen Heggen was a farmer on the farm H
2 CONC eggen. He was 30 years old when he took over as a postmaster, a position he held for 48 years. He was very involved in the village council, he was among other things in the chairmanship / municipal council and municipal committees
2 CONC . He was also very useful as a judge. He died in 1915 - 84 years old."
