2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/117352005/hactor-torjusson-wicks
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Dec. 26, 1846, Norway
2 CONT Death:  Jul. 23, 1924 Story County Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Torjuls Hactorsen Vike (1812-1867) and Christi Sjursdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madala Torresdatter Vika April 3, 1870, in Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Immigrated to the United States in 1870, first settling in Lisbon, Illinois. Hactor and Madala came to Iowa in 1875 and lived on a farm northeast of Roland until 1882. Then they moved to a farm 4 1/2 miles north of Roland where th
2 CONC ey lived for 34 years. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1916, Hactor retired from the farm and moved to Roland, spending his remaining years there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hactor and Madala had 10 children, two of whom, Millie and Thomas, died in infancy. The other known children are:
2 CONT #Elizabeth "Lizzie" Wicks Borwick (Ben Borwick), 28 May 1872-27 May 1939)
2 CONT #Christina Tomina Wicks Twedt (Andrew H. Twedt) (14 Apr 1874-20 Dec 1952)
2 CONT #Tom H. Wicks (1876-1957)
2 CONT #Julia Malinda Wicks Christenson (Albert Christenson) (23 Feb 1882-Apr 1951
2 CONT #Aseline B. "Lena" Wicks Jacobson (Jacob Eli Jacobson)(17 Apr 1883-21 Mar 1956)
2 CONT #Theodore Nickolai Wicks (12 Jul 1886-7 Nov 1950)
2 CONT #Ida Severna Wicks Waage (John Waage)
2 CONT #Millie Helena Wicks Halverson (Garfred Theodore Halverson) (Jun 1892-1967) 
2 CONT
